@startuml
state DISCOVERED
state DESIGN_IN_PROGRESS
state DESIGN_VALIDATING
state AWAITING_DESIGN_APPROVAL
state DESIGN_APPROVED
state IMPLEMENTATION_READY
state IMPLEMENTING
state IMPLEMENTATION_VALIDATING
state AWAITING_DELIVERY_APPROVAL
state COMPLETED
[*] --> DISCOVERED
DISCOVERED --> DESIGN_IN_PROGRESS : human-approved requirements
DESIGN_IN_PROGRESS --> DESIGN_VALIDATING : generate immutable artifacts
DESIGN_VALIDATING --> DESIGN_IN_PROGRESS : deterministic failure
DESIGN_VALIDATING --> AWAITING_DESIGN_APPROVAL : gates and independent review pass
AWAITING_DESIGN_APPROVAL --> DESIGN_IN_PROGRESS : human rejects
AWAITING_DESIGN_APPROVAL --> DESIGN_APPROVED : authenticated exact-bundle approval
DESIGN_APPROVED --> IMPLEMENTATION_READY : imported plan and artifacts match
IMPLEMENTATION_READY --> IMPLEMENTING : task and design gates pass
IMPLEMENTING --> IMPLEMENTATION_VALIDATING : all implementation tasks succeeded
IMPLEMENTATION_VALIDATING --> AWAITING_DELIVERY_APPROVAL : separate as-built revision validated
AWAITING_DELIVERY_APPROVAL --> IMPLEMENTATION_VALIDATING : human rejects
AWAITING_DELIVERY_APPROVAL --> COMPLETED : authenticated delivery approval
@enduml
